     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts measurement-modality-to-snomed</b></p><a name=\"measurement-modality-to-snomed\"> </a><a name=\"hcmeasurement-modality-to-snomed\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <a href=\"CodeSystem-measurement-modality.html\">TAUSSIG — Modalité de mesure</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>catheterization (Cathétérisme)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>41976001 (cathétérisme cardiaque)</td></tr><tr><td>echocardiography (Échocardiographie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>40701008 (échocardiographie)</td></tr><tr><td>cardiac_mri (IRM cardiaque)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>241620005 (IRM du cœur)</td></tr><tr><td>ct (Scanner)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>241547009 (tomodensitométrie du cœur)</td></tr><tr><td>ecg</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>29303009 (ECG)</td></tr></table></div>"
